## 5. What should you attach to your LinkedIn post?

Your post will be much stronger if you attach evidence of your implementation.

Jack B. Du - Firewall Log Analysis

EC2 dashboard screenshot

Show your running instance. Hide account IDs and sensitive details.

How To Manage Multiple SSH Connections In Linux - OSTechNix

Terminal screenshot

Show your successful SSH connection and commands.

Building an End-to-End Web Solution Architecture with AWS | Austin Corso

Architecture diagram

Explain how your application connects to AWS services.

Documentação com GitHub | Balta.io

GitHub repository

Share source code and implementation steps.

My recommendation: Include 2–3 screenshots and a GitHub repository link whenever possible.

Never expose AWS access keys, secret keys, passwords, private IP details, or confidential company information.

